g.md","cpp",{"id":27,"data":29,"filePath":32,"digest":33,"rendered":34,"legacyId":41},{"title":30,"description":31},"C++","C++ 공부 시리즈 입니다.","src/content/series/cpp.md","a1de594d6f002554",{"html":19,"metadata":35},{"headings":36,"localImagePaths":37,"remoteImagePaths":38,"frontmatter":39,"imagePaths":40},[],[],[],{"title":30,"description":31},[],"cpp.md","unity-study",{"id":42,"data":44,"filePath":47,"digest":48,"rendered":49,"legacyId":56},{"title":45,"description":46},"Unity 공부할까요","Unity가 뭘까요.","src/content/series/unity-study.md","5cf339f6da947fff",{"html":19,"metadata":50},{"headings":51,"localImagePaths":52,"remoteImagePaths":53,"frontmatter":54,"imagePaths":55},[],[],[],{"title":45,"description":46},[],"unity-study.md","computer-science",{"id":57,"data":59,"filePath":62,"digest":63,"rendered":64,"legacyId":71},{"title":60,"description":61},"컴퓨터공학","컴퓨터가 뭘까","src/content/series/computer-science.md","d065c3acb1dc4b3c",{"html":19,"metadata":65},{"headings":66,"localImagePaths":67,"remoteImagePaths":68,"frontmatter":69,"imagePaths":70},[],[],[],{"title":60,"description":61},[],"computer-science.md","posts",["Map",74,75,93,94,119,120,137,138,177,178,207,208],"cpp/type",{"id":74,"data":76,"body":80,"filePath":81,"digest":82,"rendered":83,"legacyId":92},{"title":77,"tags":78,"upload":79},"자료형",[30],"2025-07-01","테스트\r\nㅁㄴㅇㄴㅁㅇ","src/content/posts/cpp/type.md","b8f64a286490c016",{"html":84,"metadata":85},"\u003Cp>테스트\r\nㅁㄴㅇㄴㅁㅇ\u003C/p>",{"headings":86,"localImagePaths":87,"remoteImagePaths":88,"frontmatter":89,"imagePaths":91},[],[],[],{"title":77,"tags":90,"upload":79},[30],[],"cpp/type.md","computer-science/point",{"id":93,"data":95,"body":99,"filePath":100,"digest":101,"rendered":102,"legacyId":118},{"title":96,"tags":97,"upload":98},"고정소수점과 부동소수점",[60],"2025-07-02","> 컴퓨터에서 실수를 표현할 때 고정소수점과 부동소수점 방식을 사용한다.\r\n\r\n## 실수를 2진수로 변환하는 과정\r\n### 실수\r\n정수부분과 소수부분을 각각 2진수로 변환하는 과정을 거친다.\r\n\r\n10진수 3.14를 2진수로 변환하는 과정을 예로 들어 설명하겠다.\r\n\r\n우선 정수부분을 2진수로 변환하면 11이다.\r\n\r\n소수부분을 2진수로 변환하는 과정","src/content/posts/computer-science/point.md","8ef60901b31fd1e5",{"html":103,"metadata":104},"\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>컴퓨터에서 실수를 표현할 때 고정소수점과 부동소수점 방식을 사용한다.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"실수를-2진수로-변환하는-과정\">실수를 2진수로 변환하는 과정\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"실수\">실수\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>정수부분과 소수부분을 각각 2진수로 변환하는 과정을 거친다.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>10진수 3.14를 2진수로 변환하는 과정을 예로 들어 설명하겠다.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>우선 정수부분을 2진수로 변환하면 11이다.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>소수부분을 2진수로 변환하는 과정\u003C/p>",{"headings":105,"localImagePaths":113,"remoteImagePaths":114,"frontmatter":115,"imagePaths":117},[106,110],{"depth":107,"slug":108,"text":109},2,"실수를-2진수로-변환하는-과정","실수를 2진수로 변환하는 과정",{"depth":111,"slug":112,"text":112},3,"실수",[],[],{"title":96,"tags":116,"upload":98},[60],[],"computer-science/point.md","engineer-information-processing/starts",{"id":119,"data":121,"body":80,"filePath":126,"digest":127,"rendered":128,"legacyId":136},{"title":122,"tags":123,"upload":125},"시작",[124,14],"license","2025-06-30","src/content/posts/engineer-information-processing/starts.md","8da601a903b4adbb",{"html":84,"metadata":129},{"headings":130,"localImagePaths":131,"remoteImagePaths":132,"frontmatter":133,"imagePaths":135},[],[],[],{"title":122,"tags":134,"upload":125},[124,14],[],"engineer-information-processing/starts.md","unity-study/hello-unity",{"id":137,"data":139,"body":146,"filePath":147,"digest":148,"rendered":149,"legacyId":176},{"title":140,"tags":141,"upload":145},"01. 유니티 에디터",[142,143,144],"Unity","C#","dev","2025-06-28","## 1. Inspector\r\n\r\n이 글은 마크다운 기반 Next.js 블로그에서 렌더링되는 첫 번째 포스트입니다.\r\n![이미지](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/78643629/459784496-a3f647c6-843b-47b1-a59c-d35f6ab8e8c0.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..lVUiSYFziIFOxifoFIwI8duYxo5n2V6yUL20ZutTmpY)\r\n\r\n\r\n## 2. Game\r\n\r\nz\r\n![이미지](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/78643629/459784496-a3f647c6-843b-47b1-a59c-d35f6ab8e8c0.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..lVUiSYFzi